        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF152 TC39 Intl.Locale info proposal]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29748</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29748"/>
        <updated>2026-05-26T06:39:03.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF152 adds support for the <a href="https://github.com/tc39/proposal-intl-locale-info">TC39 Intl.Locale info proposal</a> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1693576" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1693576</a>, behind the pref <code class="notranslate">javascript.options.experimental.intl_locale_info</code> and <strong>only</strong> in nightly.</p>
<p dir="auto">This updates the following features with the support information:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getCalendars" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getCalendars()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getCollations" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getCollations()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getHourCycles" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getHourCycles()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getNumberingSystems" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getNumberingSystems()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getTextInfo" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getTextInfo()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getTimeZones" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getTimeZones()</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl/Locale/getWeekInfo" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Intl.Locale.prototype.getWeekInfo()</code></a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Related docs can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4470132900" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44172" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44172/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44172">mdn/content#44172</a></p>]]></content>
